While DiP was delivered to the developer community with useful capabilities, we had planned to achieve more against this year's roadmap. I recognise that technical challenges and changing priorities can affect delivery. However, I would have liked to see stronger ownership of the overall roadmap, clearer milestones and more proactive communication around progress, risks and dependencies.
